### Colección de Solicitudes HTTP — Microservicio de IA para ERP de Gimnasio (Stateless)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@clientId = 3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6

### 1. Comprobación de Salud (Liveness)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### 2. Comprobación de Modelos en Memoria (Readiness)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### 3. FLUJO INTEGRAL PRINCIPAL: Análisis Corporal (Fotos/Videos) + Recomendación Directa
# El backend del ERP envía perfil del cliente, restricciones y fotos.
# El microservicio responde con métricas posturales y la rutina estructurada para que el ERP la guarde en su BD.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pipeline/analyze-and-recommend
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundaryStateless

------WebKitFormBoundaryStateless
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="client_id"

{{clientId}}
------WebKitFormBoundaryStateless
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="age"

28
------WebKitFormBoundaryStateless
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="weight_kg"

75.5
------WebKitFormBoundaryStateless
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="height_cm"

178.0
------WebKitFormBoundaryStateless
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="fitness_level"

INTERMEDIO
------WebKitFormBoundaryStateless
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="fitness_goal"

HIPERTROFIA
------WebKitFormBoundaryStateless
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="available_days_per_week"

4
------WebKitFormBoundaryStateless
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="session_duration_minutes"

60
------WebKitFormBoundaryStateless
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="available_equipment"

["dumbbells", "barbell", "machine"]
------WebKitFormBoundaryStateless
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="physical_restrictions"

["hombro"]
------WebKitFormBoundaryStateless--

### 4. MODULAR: Análisis Postural de Fotografías (MediaPipe Pose)
# Permite al backend analizar fotografías de forma aislada.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cv/analyze-posture
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundaryPhotos

------WebKitFormBoundaryPhotos
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photo_frontal"; filename="posture_front.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./storage/sample_front.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundaryPhotos--

### 5. MODULAR: Análisis Biomecánico de Video (Sentadilla / Flexiones)
# Conteo de repeticiones, cadencia y detección de profundidad articular.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cv/analyze-movement
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundaryVideo

------WebKitFormBoundaryVideo
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="exercise_type"

SQUAT
------WebKitFormBoundaryVideo
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="video"; filename="squat.mp4"
Content-Type: video/mp4

< ./storage/sample_squat.mp4
------WebKitFormBoundaryVideo--

### 6. MODULAR: Generación de Recomendaciones y Rutinas por JSON
# Cuando el backend del ERP ya tiene los datos y fotos analizadas, solo pide la rutina.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/recommendations/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "client_id": "{{clientId}}",
  "age": 28,
  "weight_kg": 75.5,
  "height_cm": 178.0,
  "fitness_level": "INTERMEDIO",
  "fitness_goal": "HIPERTROFIA",
  "available_days_per_week": 4,
  "session_duration_minutes": 60,
  "available_equipment": ["dumbbells", "barbell", "machine"],
  "physical_restrictions": ["hombro"],
  "posture_findings": ["ligera_asimetria_escapular"],
  "top_k": 10
}
